Package: sujimichi
Title: Visualize the Logical Structure of Japanese Text
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Toshikazu", "Matsumura", , "matutosi@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Reveals how a Japanese text holds together by linking each
    sentence to the earlier sentences that share a content word. Sentences
    are shown connected at the shared words, so the line of reasoning
    becomes visible, and a sentence that shares no word with any other is
    reported in the same way as dead code in a program. Morphological
    analysis is done locally through 'moranajp'.
